    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοηδρομ-έω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοᾱ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run to a cry for aid, haste to help</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς δόμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1356
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἐσχάραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Heracl.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ νικώμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sert.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν ἵπποις, Ἀρχ. Δελτ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.57
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thermon</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>run with a cry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hann.</u>
				42
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύραννον ἀνελεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.119
				</span></i>
			.</div>
